{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Masquerades bring some of the most refined loot. The Y5S1 Legacy Pass brings back 100 tiers of rewards from the Y5S1 Battle Pass. Available during Y9S1 only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Legacy Pass includes the following rewards:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 1 Execution (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 1 Weapon Set (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 1 Signature (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 2 Battle Outfits (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 2 Effects (idle\\emote\\execution per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Color Swatches, Paint Patterns, Symbols, Emblem Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A special 101 tier including all above content for all heroes released after Y5S1 to date</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you already own the Y5S1 Battle Pass, you do not need to purchase the Legacy Pass and you will continue where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Y5S1 Legacy Pass is available until June 10, 2025, and is not eligible for refund.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534440?t=1741871464","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534440?t=1741871464","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534440/ef36000ac62ea64a8168baf0880d138ccc98a70b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741871464","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534440/ef36000ac62ea64a8168baf0880d138ccc98a70b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741871464","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam T